      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "One strong argument is that widespread AI adoption will lead to mass structural unemployment, making a guaranteed income necessary for basic societal stability and demand.  Proponents argue that UBI can serve as a crucial safety net, enabling people to reskill or pursue more meaningful, non-market \"human-centric\" work, rather than being forced into precarious, low-wage \"gig work.\" Furthermore, it can act as an economic stabilizer, providing consistent consumer power to support the very complex, highly advanced AI and automated systems that are driving the transformation.",
